#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you’ve submitted your proposal! You can continue to make "
"changes to it up to the submission deadline, and you will be notified of any"
" changes or questions."
msgstr ""
"Your application has been submitted. You can keep editing it until the "
"deadline, and we will email you at every step."

#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid ""
"Your draft was saved. You can continue to edit it as long as the CfP is "
"open."
msgstr ""
"Your draft was saved. You can come back and finish it any time before the "
"deadline."

# --- Tier B: strings that are actively wrong for a job application ----------
#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_profile.html
msgid ""
"This data will be displayed publicly if your proposal is accepted. It is "
"also visible to reviewers."
msgstr ""
"This information is visible to reviewers and organisers. It must not be "
"published unless you have explicitly agreed to publication."

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/login.html
msgid ""
"You do not need an account to view the event, or submit feedback, or receive"
" schedule updates. You’ll only need an account if you participate in the "
"event as speaker or as an organiser."
msgstr ""
"You need an account to apply, and to check the status of your application "
"later."

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submissions.html
msgid "It seems like you haven’t submitted anything to this event yet."
msgstr "You have not submitted an application yet."

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submissions.html
msgid ""
"If you did not, why not go ahead and create a proposal now? We’d love to "
"hear from you!"
msgstr "If you would like to apply, you can start now."

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submissions.html
msgid "Submit something now!"
msgstr "Start your application"

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submission_edit.html
#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submission_withdraw.html
msgid "Withdraw proposal"
msgstr "Withdraw application"

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submission_withdraw.html
msgid "Do you really want to withdraw your proposal?"
msgstr "Do you really want to withdraw your application?"

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/user_submission_edit.html
msgid ""
"You can withdraw your proposal from the selection process here. You cannot "
"undo this - if you are just uncertain if you can or should hold your "
"session, please contact the organiser instead."
msgstr ""
"You can withdraw your application from the selection procedure here. This "
"cannot be undone. If you are simply unsure, please get in touch instead."

#: pretalx/person/models/user.py
msgid ""
"Your email address will be used for password resets and notification about "
"your event/proposals."
msgstr "We will use this address for everything to do with your application."

# --- Tier C: polish --------------------------------------------------------
#: pretalx/submission/enums.py pretalx/submission/phrases.py
msgctxt "proposal status"
msgid "submitted"
msgstr "received"

#: pretalx/submission/phrases.py
msgctxt "proposal status"
msgid "in review"
msgstr "under review"

#: pretalx/submission/phrases.py
msgctxt "proposal status"
