msgstr "not shortlisted"

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/submission_base.html
msgid "or save as draft for now"
msgstr "or save and finish later"

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/event/submission_base.html
msgid ""
"You can save your proposal as a draft and submit it later. Organisers will "
"not be able to see your proposal, though they will be able to send you "
"reminder emails about the upcoming deadline."
msgstr ""
"You can save an unfinished application and come back to it. We cannot see "
"drafts — we can only send you a reminder before the deadline."

#: pretalx/cfp/phrases.py
msgid "Your proposal has been withdrawn."
msgstr "Your application has been withdrawn."

#: pretalx/cfp/templates/cfp/includes/user_submission_header.html
msgid ""
"This is a draft proposal. It will never be visible to anybody else, unless "
"you submit it or explicitly share it."
msgstr ""
"This is an unfinished application. We cannot see it until you submit it."

