"Reviewers will be able to see and review <strong>all proposals</strong>, but"
" their assigned reviews will appear highlighted, and they will be directed "
"to them first. You can change this in your <a href=\"%(href)s\" >review "
"settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"Reviewers will see and review <strong>all applications</strong>, but the "
"ones assigned to them appear highlighted and come first. You can change this"
" in your <a href=\"%(href)s\">review settings</a>."

#: pretalx/orga/templates/orga/review/assignment.html
msgid ""
"This is where you can assign reviewers to specific proposals! Please use "
"this drop-down to switch between the two assignment modes (assigning "
"reviewers to proposals or proposals to reviewers)."
msgstr ""
"Assign reviewers to individual applications here. Use the drop-down to "
"switch between the two assignment modes: reviewers to applications, or "
"applications to reviewers."

