#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid ""
"We’re glad that you want to contribute to our event with your proposal. "
"Let’s get started, this won’t take long."
msgstr ""
"We’re glad that you want to apply to this call. Let’s get started — it won’t"
" take long."

#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid "Before we can save your proposal, we have some more questions for you."
msgstr ""
"Before we can save your application, we have a few more questions for you."

#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid "That’s it about your proposal! We now just need a way to contact you."
msgstr ""
"That’s everything about your application. We now need your contact details."

#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid ""
"To create your proposal, you need an account on this page. This not only "
"gives us a way to contact you, it also gives you the possibility to edit "
"your proposal or to view its current state."
msgstr ""
"You need an account to apply. It lets us contact you and lets you edit your "
"application or check its status."

#: pretalx/cfp/flow/steps.py
msgid ""
"This information will be publicly displayed next to your session - you can "
"always edit for as long as proposals are still open."
msgstr ""
"This information is part of your application and is visible to the "
"recruitment team. You can edit it while applications are open."

#: pretalx/cfp/phrases.py
msgid ""
"Your proposal can’t be withdrawn at this time – please contact us if you "
"need to withdraw your proposal!"
msgstr ""
"Your application can’t be withdrawn at this time – please contact us if you "
"need to withdraw your application!"

#: pretalx/cfp/phrases.py
msgid "Your session has been confirmed – we’re looking forward to seeing you!"
msgstr ""
"Your interview attendance is confirmed — we look forward to meeting you!"

#: pretalx/cfp/phrases.py
msgid ""
"This proposal has already been confirmed – we’re looking forward to seeing "
"you!"
msgstr ""
"You have already confirmed your interview attendance — we look forward to "
"meeting you!"

#: pretalx/cfp/phrases.py
msgid ""
"This proposal cannot be confirmed at this time – please contact us if you "
"think this is an error."
msgstr ""
"This application cannot be confirmed at this time – please contact us if you"
" think this is an error."

#: pretalx/cfp/phrases.py
msgid ""
"This proposal cannot be edited at this time. Please contact the organisers "
"if you need to make changes."
msgstr ""
"This application cannot be edited at this time. Please contact the "
"organisers if you need to make changes."

