"Hi!\n"
"\n"
"I’d like to invite you to be an applicant in the interview\n"
"\n"
"  “{proposal_title}”\n"
"\n"
"at {event_name}. Please follow this link to join:\n"
"\n"
"  {url}\n"
"\n"
"I’m looking forward to it!\n"
"{inviting_speaker}"

