"questions! We will reach out again before the conference to tell you details\n"
"about your slot in the schedule and technical details concerning the room\n"
"and presentation tech.\n"
"\n"
"See you there!\n"
"The {event_name} organisers"
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"We are pleased to tell you that your application “{submission_title}” has been shortlisted for {event_name}. Please use this link to confirm that you wish to attend an interview:\n"
"\n"
"{confirmation_link}\n"
"\n"
"We will send your interview time and location separately. Please contact us if you have any questions.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards,\n"
"The {event_name} recruitment team"

